{"4112640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Shattered Realm Rebirth", "steam_appid": 4112640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Background</strong><br>This is a high-freedom hack-and-slash dual-world rogue-lite endless challenge game. Master time, fight your way out. Besides its core feature of switching between surface and inner worlds, the game incorporates mainstream action rogue-lite randomized attribute combinations, ensuring each playthrough offers a fresh experience. It also minimizes grind, focusing on极致爽快感 (ultimate thrill) to enhance replay value.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112640/extras/9e1864576d651c0be807555a61084f58.poster.avif?t=1773044248\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112640/extras/9e1864576d651c0be807555a61084f58.webm?t=1773044248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112640/extras/9e1864576d651c0be807555a61084f58.mp4?t=1773044248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112640/extras/98aa2ddb8991156a9b8114ef8cc7af49.poster.avif?t=1773044248\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112640/extras/98aa2ddb8991156a9b8114ef8cc7af49.webm?t=1773044248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112640/extras/98aa2ddb8991156a9b8114ef8cc7af49.mp4?t=1773044248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong><br>The game boasts numerous random map events. The dual-world system allows the protagonist to travel between past and future or alternate dimensions. The inner world is filled with treasures and surprises, though enemies are stronger. Will you know when to stop or greedily push forward? Even a rough start can be reversed, and finding god-tier equipment early can make a run incredibly fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112640/extras/5a9375bdb34935f726947b72e1ff6a6a.poster.avif?t=1773044248\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112640/extras/5a9375bdb34935f726947b72e1ff6a6a.webm?t=1773044248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112640/extras/5a9375bdb34935f726947b72e1ff6a6a.mp4?t=1773044248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat System<br>With a vast arsenal, each weapon has unique mechanics and exclusive ultimate skills. Combining them with different blessings creates powerful synergies. Beyond standard attacks, you can block, parry, and dodge. Whether you're a novice, expert, or gambler, everyone can enjoy thrilling combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112640/extras/a712454b1ee6fce13f91baead9e05efe.poster.avif?t=1773044248\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112640/extras/a712454b1ee6fce13f91baead9e05efe.webm?t=1773044248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112640/extras/a712454b1ee6fce13f91baead9e05efe.mp4?t=1773044248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blessing System<br>As you progress, unlock blessing links from various NPCs. Each NPC offers 10-20 randomized blessings, with hundreds of combinations available. Builds cater to all styles: aggressive duelists, evasion specialists, parry masters, skill users, ultimate spammers, etc. Find your perfect playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112640/extras/246f4164ce34d0b35b9f9ac68a0e4a18.poster.avif?t=1773044248\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112640/extras/246f4164ce34d0b35b9f9ac68a0e4a18.webm?t=1773044248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112640/extras/246f4164ce34d0b35b9f9ac68a0e4a18.mp4?t=1773044248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression Systems<br>In addition to the above, the game features statue systems, crystal core systems, item systems, talent trees, and more, significantly enriching gameplay. These allow you to tailor your initial growth path toward preferred strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112640/extras/02de94518f99efaefe7db49aa6424e44.poster.avif?t=1773044248\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112640/extras/02de94518f99efaefe7db49aa6424e44.webm?t=1773044248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112640/extras/02de94518f99efaefe7db49aa6424e44.mp4?t=1773044248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Endings<br>The game employs a multi-branch, multi-ending structure to maximize replayability.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Background</strong><br>This is a high-freedom hack-and-slash dual-world rogue-lite endless challenge game. Master time, fight your way out. Besides its core feature of switching between surface and inner worlds, the game incorporates mainstream action rogue-lite randomized attribute combinations, ensuring each playthrough offers a fresh experience. It also minimizes grind, focusing on极致爽快感 (ultimate thrill) to enhance replay value.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112640/extras/9e1864576d651c0be807555a61084f58.poster.avif?t=1773044248\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112640/extras/9e1864576d651c0be807555a61084f58.webm?t=1773044248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112640/extras/9e1864576d651c0be807555a61084f58.mp4?t=1773044248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112640/extras/98aa2ddb8991156a9b8114ef8cc7af49.poster.avif?t=1773044248\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112640/extras/98aa2ddb8991156a9b8114ef8cc7af49.webm?t=1773044248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112640/extras/98aa2ddb8991156a9b8114ef8cc7af49.mp4?t=1773044248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong><br>The ga